=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Ohbiru-Dohbiru (A)} at (H-7) and tell him you have found a pink fiend in the area.
** He is located near Conflux #07.
* Next talk to {p:Kenapa-Keppa (A)} in the northeast corner of (I-7) to receive {@k} {k:Bucket of compound compost}.
* Click the **Lycopodium Rootprint** targetable location which is west of the mountain at (H-7).
** This will spawn {m:Rubicund Adenium}, a {p:Mandragora}.
* Bring it to {p:Kenapa-Keppa (A)} to capture it, making sure not to let it despawn along the way (keep it within 20').
* Lastly, speak with {p:Kenapa-Keppa (A)} after the full {s:Warp II} animation to complete the quest.

__Zoning **is** required to repeat this quest.__
\**Note:** This quest may only be completed **once** per Vana'diel day.
